
# 🧠 MindCare – AI Mental Health Support & Counseling Platform

 📌 Overview

MindCare is a Django-based AI-powered mental wellness platform that helps users share emotions, detect mental health status using Machine Learning, connect with caretakers, and receive counseling support in real time.

The system combines sentiment analysis, OCR-based content moderation, chatbot assistance, secure payments, and live caretaker chat to create a smart mental health ecosystem.

---

 🚀 Problem Solved

Mental health issues often go unnoticed due to lack of support and monitoring.

MindCare solves this by:

* Detecting emotional state from user posts
* Identifying users needing counseling support
* Blocking harmful/inappropriate content
* Connecting users with professional caretakers
* Providing secure private counseling chat

---

 🧠 AI / ML Models Used

 Sentiment Analysis

* Logistic Regression
* CountVectorizer (NLP)

Detects emotions:

* Happiness
* Sadness
* Anger
* Neutral

---

 OCR-Based Content Moderation

* Tesseract OCR
* OpenCV Image Processing

Detects restricted words inside uploaded images.

---

 AI Chatbot Support

* Gemini AI Integration *(optional support module)*

Provides mental health guidance and instant assistance.

---

 📊 Dataset Used

 Emotion Dataset

```bash id="1dd2"
mydata1.csv
```

Contains labeled emotional text samples.

 Restricted Word Dataset

```bash id="2ddd"
english.csv
```

Used for content moderation.

