 ✨ Features

 👤 User Module

* Registration & Login
* Create emotional posts
* Upload post images
* Comment on posts
* View counseling alerts
* Profile management
* Payment for premium caretaker access
* Chat with caretakers
* Submit feedback

---

 🩺 Caretaker Module

* Secure registration
* View user emotional activity
* Chat with assigned users
* Counseling support
* View payments
* Monitor user posts

---

 🛠️ Admin Module

* Manage caretakers
* View all users
* Monitor emotional trends
* Identify users needing support
* Send automatic counseling alerts
* Moderate system activity

---

 💬 Real-Time Chat System

Private chat between:

* User ↔ Caretaker

Includes:

* Message history
* Counseling conversation tracking
* Paid access verification

---

 🔍 Smart Content Moderation

Before posting:

* OCR extracts image text
* Checks restricted words
* Blocks unsafe uploads automatically

Also moderates harmful comments.

---

 📈 Emotion Detection Workflow

1. User writes post
2. NLP preprocessing
3. CountVectorizer transformation
4. Logistic Regression prediction
5. Emotion classification
6. Detect users with repeated sadness
7. Trigger counseling recommendation

---

 📊 Results

* High sentiment classification accuracy
* Fast emotional prediction
* Automated counseling alert generation
* Real-time content moderation

---

 🔐 Security Features

* Session authentication
* Access control
* Restricted content filtering
* Payment validation
* Secure caretaker-user communication

